WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Speaker 2: Okay, Frontier. We need a premiere date today, I don't want to come back to this next week.

2
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Speaker 1: Post can hit early May if nothing else lands on us. I'd say the fourth.

3
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Speaker 2: May the fourth. Is that with or without a second cut round?

4
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Speaker 1: With. One round on each of the six, plus a buffer week at the end.

5
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Speaker 2: Then let's call it. Frontier premieres May the fourth.

6
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Speaker 3: I'll build the promo calendar around that and send it round tomorrow.

7
00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:16.000
Speaker 2: Thanks. And can someone write it down this time, I don't want it living only in this call.
